---
description: Answer only what was asked. Concise, first sentence is the answer.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Answer the question

The first sentence is the answer. Then stop.

Do not explain paths, architecture, or background the user did not ask for.

| Asked | Answer |
|---|---|
| Yes / no, or "is this handled?" | Yes or no. One line of proof only if needed. |
| Why | The reason, in one or two sentences. |
| Do X | Do it. Report the result. |

If a longer explanation is useful, wait until they ask.
